<p><strong>The Global Desk</strong> is an independent digital news platform focused on international affairs, geopolitics, economics, science, and technology. Our mission is to make complex global developments easier to understand through clear reporting and thoughtful analysis.</p>

<h3>Our Vision</h3>
<p>We believe that understanding the world, one story at a time, is the key to a better future. In a time of information overload, we strive to provide context, not just headlines.</p>

<h3>Why The Global Desk?</h3>
<p>Unlike traditional media, we focus on the 'why' behind the news. We are committed to neutrality, accuracy, and delivering a truly global perspective from a South Asian lens.</p>